# Normalize line endings.
#
# This repository is text-only (Markdown, JSON, .mjs). Everything is stored
# with LF in the object database and checked out with LF on every platform.
#
# Without this file, a Windows contributor with `core.autocrlf=true` sees the
# entire tree (~400 files) as modified after a fresh clone, which buries the
# real diff. Explicitly pinning `eol=lf` also makes the docs build byte-stable
# across platforms, so `npm run build:docs -- --check` behaves the same in CI
# and on a developer machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Defensive: if binary assets are ever added, never touch their bytes.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
